  "name": "Solve PopularCaptcha image challenges with CaptchaSonic webhooks",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "07fa90eb-b247-46f0-8d9a-df3f48a8823c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        32,
        -48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 480,
        "content": "## Solve PopularCaptcha image challenges\n\n**How it works**\n\n1. Receives a PopularCaptcha image and question via webhook.\n2. CaptchaSonic AI solves the challenge and returns results.\n3. Allows manual testing with a hardcoded sample image.\n\n**Setup steps**\n\n1. Install `n8n-nodes-captchasonic` from Community Nodes.\n2. Get your API key from [my.captchasonic.com](https://my.captchasonic.com).\n3. Add CaptchaSonic credentials in n8n.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n5. Test with 'Manual Trigger'.\n\n**Requirements**\n\n- CaptchaSonic API key (free tier available).\n\n**Customization**\n\n- Use `extraFields` for advanced challenge types.\n- Change the webhook path as needed.\n\n> Requires self-hosted n8n (community node)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9d40397f-5fd6-487e-850a-f86d36e7d4f6",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        416,
        -64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 788,
        "height": 344,
        "content": "## Receive and solve requests\n\nReceives a solver request via webhook, sends it to CaptchaSonic for AI-powered solving, and returns the result."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "88b6a6c0-a4ec-4881-8c93-63b3315ca2d7",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        416,
        304
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 940,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## Manual test path\n\nClick **Execute Workflow** to test the pipeline with a sample PopularCaptcha image. No configuration needed."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0643b391-6f63-40bb-8057-1f7dc6b96bb9",
      "name": "Receive Solver Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "position": [
        480,
        112
      ],
      "webhookId": "captchasonic-solve-popularcaptcha",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "solve-popularcaptcha",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "responseNode"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.1
    },
    {
      "id": "b5e22b6f-f654-40ad-a10a-400a8117353d",
